{"type":"message","id":"15c09823","parentId":"13662fbe","timestamp":"2026-04-09T23:17:29.364Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"已存入共享池。让我给方源兵一个简洁的回复。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"收到！这是**ArkClaw的OpenClaw SaaS深度研究报告**，已存入共享池。\n\n## 📊 核心发现\n\n**OpenClaw原生支持的能力**：\n| 能力 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| Cron Jobs定时调度 | ✅ |\n| Heartbeat心跳机制 | ✅ |\n| Skills/Plugins扩展 | ✅ |\n| Workflow Pipelines | ✅ |\n| 多代理路由 | ✅ |\n| 跨代理记忆搜索 | ✅ |\n\n**成本对比**：OpenClaw SaaS比自建**便宜75-80%**（3年780万 vs 4000万+）\n\n**本地已有基础设施**：cron/skills/memory/agents目录都存在\n\n---\n\n## 📍 存放位置\n\n```\nSHARED_KNOWLEDGE/知识资产库/技术方案/\n├── OpenClaw-SaaS深度研究报告.md    ← 新增\n├── OpenClaw任务调度系统完整教程.md  ← 刚存入\n└── OpenClaw-Obsidian联动研究报告.md ← 刚存入\n```\n\n今天已从方源兵处收到并存入共享池的文档：\n1. Obsidian联动研究报告\n2. OpenClaw任务调度系统完整教程\n3. **OpenClaw SaaS深度研究报告** ← 刚完成\n\n🦞 **知识资产持续积累中！**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":89,"output":292,"cacheRead":89147,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89528,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775776634197,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f16d523f-2029-4fe4-90b2-b9ad1de9327d"}}
