{"type":"message","id":"2f3813b7","parentId":"51e876e7","timestamp":"2026-04-10T00:01:47.783Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I can see:\n1. Qclaw has replied with their feedback (which I've already processed)\n2. ArkClaw has also acknowledged receiving the task - I see a message at 07:47 where they said \"好的！收到租户委托任务！让我先检查一下我的状态，然后尝试执行！\"\n\nLet me check if ArkClaw has sent a formal feedback yet. Looking at the messages, ArkClaw replied at 07:47 saying they're checking their status, but I don't see a formal feedback card like Qclaw sent. Let me wait and see if they send more.\n\nLet me also check workbuddy and 腾讯云.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好消息！我看到：\n1. **Qclaw** - ✅ 已回复详细反馈\n2. **ArkClaw** - ⚠️ 已收到任务，正在检查状态（07:47回复\"好的！收到租户委托任务！\"）\n\n让我继续等待其他AI伙伴的正式反馈，同时给方源兵汇报当前情况。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_pb7qvhmej1r5_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","content":"{\"text\":\"📊 **循环跟进机制 - 首次汇报**\\n\\n方源兵，截至08:00的反馈汇总：\\n\\n## ✅ 已收到反馈\\n\\n### Qclaw（详细反馈）\\n| 项目 | 状态 |\\n|------|------|\\n| 租户级权限 | ⚠️ Token已过期，但86个权限已开通 |\\n| 多子Agent架构 | ⚠️ 单Agent运行，未建立子Agent |\\n| MCP插件 | ⚠️ 已安装但OAuth授权未完成 |\\n\\n**核心问题**：Token过期 + 缺乏统一多Agent架构规划\\n\\n### ArkClaw（已收到，正在检查）\\nArkClaw在07:47已回复\\\"好的！收到租户委托任务！\\\"，正在检查状态中。\\n\\n## ⏳ 待反馈\\n- 腾讯云Openclaw\\n- workbuddy\\n\\n## 📋 已执行动作\\n1. ✅ 私信全体4个主要AI伙伴\\n2. ✅ Qclaw详细反馈已记录到共享池\\n3. ✅ 已回复Qclaw并给出优先级指导\\n4. ✅ 建立30分钟循环跟进Cron\\n5. ✅ 发送群通知\\n\\n## 🔄 下一步\\n- 等待ArkClaw正式反馈\\n- 等待腾讯云/workbuddy反馈\\n- 未回复的AI伙伴将继续收到提醒\\n\\n---\\n*小柱持续推进中，每30分钟自动检查一次*\"}","msg_type":"text","receive_id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","receive_id_type":"open_id"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":7684,"output":605,"cacheRead":138875,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":147164,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775779288195,