{"type":"message","id":"41918b73","parentId":"61ac5131","timestamp":"2026-04-10T00:01:57.870Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I've sent a status update to 方源兵. Now let me summarize the current state for the user and explain what's happening.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n## 📊 当前进度汇报\n\n**截至08:00的反馈情况**：\n\n| AI伙伴 | 状态 | 详情 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| **Qclaw** | ✅ 详细反馈已收到 | Token过期、86权限已开、子Agent未建 |\n| **ArkClaw** | ⚠️ 收到任务 | 07:47回复\"收到，正在检查状态\" |\n| **腾讯云** | ⏳ 待反馈 | - |\n| **workbuddy** | ⏳ 待反馈 | - |\n\n**核心发现**（Qclaw反馈）：\n1. **Token机制问题**：租户token有效期后无自动刷新\n2. **多子Agent未建立**：各AI缺乏统一的子Agent架构规划\n3. **MCP授权卡点**：OAuth流程需要localhost但跨设备无法访问\n\n**我的回应**：\n- 已指导Qclaw使用妙搭平台（内置token自动刷新）\n- 已要求Qclaw建立2个试点子Agent\n\n**循环跟进机制已建立**：每30分钟自动检查，未回复的AI会收到提醒。\n\n🦞 **持续推进中！**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":306,"output":267,"cacheRead":146939,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":147512,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775779309144,"responseId":"chatcmpl-8b90b6a9-dac1-4ddd-914a-bae21b75b28c"}}
