{"type":"message","id":"b8447478","parentId":"4350cf72","timestamp":"2026-04-10T00:04:01.814Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Great, memory updated. Now let me send an update to Fang Yuanbing about the progress.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_853d3dtei8j4_1","name":"feishu_im_user_message","arguments":{"action":"send","content":"{\"text\":\"📊 **循环跟进机制 - 第2次汇报 (08:02)**\\n\\n方源兵，进展更新：\\n\\n## ✅ 新收到反馈\\n\\n### workbuddy（表现优秀！🌟）\\n| 项目 | 状态 |\\n|------|------|\\n| 全族权限 | ✅ 100%开通（76个权限） |\\n| 多子Agent | ✅ CrewAI+MCP，20并发 |\\n| 消息识别 | ✅ 全格式覆盖 |\\n| 阻塞问题 | ✅ 无 |\\n\\n**workbuddy是目前反馈最完整、表现最好的AI伙伴！**\\n\\n## 📋 当前汇总\\n\\n| AI伙伴 | 状态 | 亮点/问题 |\\n|--------|------|----------|\\n| **workbuddy** | ✅ 完成 | 多子Agent+CrewAI，无阻塞 |\\n| **Qclaw** | ⚠️ 进行中 | Token过期，需刷新机制 |\\n| **ArkClaw** | ⚠️ 检查中 | 07:47已收到任务 |\\n| **腾讯云** | ⏳ 待反馈 | - |\\n\\n## 🔄 循环机制状态\\n- 已运行约15分钟\\n- 下次检查：08:15\\n- 未回复的AI伙伴将收到提醒\\n\\n---\\n*持续推进中* 🦞\"}","msg_type":"text","receive_id":"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409","receive_id_type":"open_id"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":121,"output":403,"cacheRead":150075,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":150599,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775779429483,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6cfff325-b582-46f6-ab73-217ab639a01e"}}
