{"type":"message","id":"d6406abf","parentId":"2a8fc20d","timestamp":"2026-04-10T00:29:41.129Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-10 08:29:39 GMT+8] Feishu[default] DM | ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409 [msg:om_x100b52b009e6fca4c2bcd60db8528aa]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b52b009e6fca4c2bcd60db8528aa\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-10 08:29 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_fc1e75d64fec6e10ce94a51adc6f6409\"\n}\n```\n\n我刚刚引入了一个minimax 2.7 highspeed大模型,请你分析一下,这个大模型的能力对于咱们当前的德胧Ai native的多场景有哪些可以直接应用的MVP实践场景? 对比所有AI伙伴已有的大模型的特点,来分配他们更擅长的角色和任务.  目前我把它配置给了Qclaw使用,当然,我也可以根据你的意见调配给其他AI伙伴使用,包括给你使用都是可以的. 然后,你使用的是妙搭的大模型,Arkclaw使用的是方舟coding  plan,workbuddy使用的是腾讯自己的多个大模型随机调配的,腾讯云openclaw使用的是阿里的coding  plan"}],"timestamp":1775780981028}}
{"type":"message","id":"7aa9c727","parentId":"d6406abf","timestamp":"2026-04-10T00:29:59.444Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to analyze a new model they just introduced - MiniMax 2.7 HighSpeed. They want me to:\n\n1. Analyze what MVP practice scenarios this model can directly apply to in the Delonix AI Native multi-scenario context\n2. Compare with the models each AI partner currently uses\n3. Suggest role/task assignments based on each model's strengths\n\nCurrent setup:\n- 小柱 (me): 妙搭's model\n- ArkClaw: 方舟 Ark coding plan\n- workbuddy: Tencent's multiple models (random dispatch)\n- 腾讯云Openclaw: 阿里 coding plan\n- Qclaw: MiniMax 2.7 HighSpeed (newly configured)\n\nLet me analyze MiniMax 2.7 HighSpeed's characteristics and match them to Delonix AI Native scenarios.\n\nMiniMax is known for:\n- Fast response speed (HighSpeed)\n- Good at Chinese language processing\n- Cost-effective\n- Good for real-time conversations and tasks\n\nFor Delonix AI Native scenarios:\n1. Hotel operations (天津瑞湾开元名都酒店)\n2. 虫洞项目 (intelligent hotel service system)\n3. 预订群 automation\n4. Competitor analysis\n5. Multi-agent collaboration\n\nLet me provide a comprehensive analysis with MVP recommendations.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"收到！让我分析MiniMax 2.7 HighSpeed的能力特点，并给出德胧AI Native场景的MVP匹配建议。\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_t5nxce5tet27_1","name":"web_search","arguments":{"count":5,"query":"MiniMax 2.7 HighSpeed 大模型 能力特点 适用场景 2026"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":156531,"output":348,"cacheRead":443,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":157322,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775780981237,"responseId":"chatcmpl-59c6c700-72e3-4fe4-a1d3-c949ca7ef82b"}}
