{"type":"message","id":"ae214138","parentId":"54acf94b","timestamp":"2026-04-10T00:33:13.963Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"已写入共享池并给Qclaw发送了MiniMax任务。让我给用户汇报并更新记忆。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_g17upfntofxp_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"edits":[{"newText":"## 08:29 MiniMax 2.7 HighSpeed分析完成\n- 已分析MiniMax模型能力特点\n- 已写入共享池：`知识资产库/技术方案/德胧AI伙伴模型能力分析.md`\n- 建议Qclaw专注：实时消息处理、高频任务\n- 互补模式：Qclaw(高速) + 小柱(深度)","oldText":"## 08:20 晁留柱确认"}],"path":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/memory/2026-04-10.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":534,"output":178,"cacheRead":159483,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":160195,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775781185297,"responseId":"chatcmpl-02937355-5b58-4528-8951-103b02f443fa"}}
