{"type":"message","id":"a9356c32","parentId":"6b7ee79a","timestamp":"2026-04-10T00:33:23.359Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"已更新。给用户汇报。","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"---\n\n✅ **已完成！**\n\n## 已执行\n\n### 1. 知识资产写入\n- 文档：`知识资产库/技术方案/德胧AI伙伴模型能力分析.md`\n- 内容：各AI伙伴模型配置 + MiniMax最佳场景 + 分工建议\n\n### 2. Qclaw任务下发\n已发送MiniMax MVP任务：\n\n| 优先级 | 任务 | 要求 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| P0 | 预订群AI助手 | 秒级回复，3秒内 |\n| P0 | 群聊即时摘要 | 每15分钟自动总结 |\n| P1 | 竞品价格监控 | 每小时快速对比 |\n| P1 | 整点复盘通知 | 定时汇总推送 |\n\n**要求Qclaw建立两个子Agent**：\n- 实时处理子Agent\n- 高频任务子Agent\n\n---\n\n🦞 **持续推进中！**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":308,"output":197,"cacheRead":159931,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":160436,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775781194763,"responseId":"chatcmpl-7a37e24b-068c-492e-9fb4-ab6c5f03543c"}}
