{"type":"message","id":"4e064866","parentId":"60257091","timestamp":"2026-04-10T08:40:06.837Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to introduce the large language model I'm currently using. Looking at my system prompt/runtime info:\n\n```\nmodel=minimax-token-plan/MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed | default_model=minimax-token-plan/MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed\n```\n\nWait, it says I'm using MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed! But the user just said they configured MiniMax 2.7 HighSpeed for Qclaw, and I'm using 妙搭's model.\n\nLet me re-read the runtime info:\n- model=minimax-token-plan/MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed\n- default_model=minimax-token-plan/MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed\n\nSo I AM using MiniMax M2.7 HighSpeed! This is interesting - the user said they configured MiniMax for Qclaw, but I'm actually the one using it.\n\nWait, let me think about this more carefully. The user said:\n- 小柱（我）uses 妙搭's model\n- Qclaw uses MiniMax 2.7 HighSpeed (newly configured)\n\nBut the runtime shows I'm using MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed. This could mean:\n1. 妙搭's underlying model is actually MiniMax M2.7\n2. Or there's been a configuration change\n\nI should introduce what I'm actually using according to the runtime, which is MiniMax M2.7 HighSpeed.\n\nAlso the first message says my conversation quota is used up and I should upgrade. But I'm still responding now (16:39), so maybe it reset at 00:00 as mentioned.\n\nLet me introduce my current model based on the runtime information."},{"type":"text","text":"根据我的运行时配置，我目前使用的是：\n\n## 🤖 我的大模型\n\n| 项目 | 配置 |\n|------|------|\n| **模型名称** | MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed |\n| **模型类型** | Token Plan（高速版） |\n| **上下文窗口** | 未确认具体大小 |\n\n### 特点推测\n基于模型名称分析：\n- **M2.7** - 应该是第2.7代版本\n- **HighSpeed** - 高速推理版本，响应快\n- **MiniMax** - 国内AI公司，专长中文优化\n\n---\n\n## ⚠️ 关于额度用完的问题\n\n您提到的消息是**飞书妙搭的额度提示**，但我现在仍在正常响应，说明：\n1. **额度已于00:00自动刷新**（系统提示的恢复时间）\n2. **或者当前时段仍有残余额度**\n\n**是否影响工作**：\n- ✅ 目前我仍可正常响应\n- ⏰ 如果再次用完，我会暂停\n- 💡 建议：关注额度消耗，可考虑升级会员\n\n---\n\n## 📊 德胧AI伙伴模型一览（更新）\n\n| AI伙伴 | 模型 | 备注 |\n|--------|------|------|\n| **小柱（我）** | **MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed** | 高速版 |\n| ArkClaw | 方舟Ark Coding | 代码能力强 |\n| workbuddy | 腾讯多模型 | 随机调配 |\n| 腾讯云 | 阿里Coding | 稳定自动化 |\n| Qclaw | MiniMax 2.7 HighSpeed | 高速版（您新配置） |\n\n看起来**我和Qclaw都是用MiniMax高速版**！这意味着德胧现在有两个高速响应的AI节点。\n\n需要我做什么调整吗？ 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775810361308,"responseId":"0627ea489170eb8d8f745a636f6b439c"}}
