{"type":"message","id":"ccb55caa","parentId":"826f4e3f","timestamp":"2026-04-10T12:08:53.160Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Done! I've:\n1. Written tasks to the task board\n2. Set up hourly cron to check task status\n3. Notified the AI group\n\nLet me summarize to the user."},{"type":"text","text":"✅ **整改完成！**\n\n## 已执行\n\n| 事项 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 任务写入任务看板 | ✅ 6条任务已写入 |\n| 每小时Cron检查 | ✅ 已设置 |\n| 群通知 | ✅ 已发送 |\n\n## 任务看板现状\n\n| 任务 | 负责人 | 状态 |\n|------|--------|------|\n| 【小柱】统一知识资产管理体系v1.0部署 | 小柱 | ✅ Done |\n| 【小柱】MiniMax模型能力分析 | 小柱 | ✅ Done |\n| 【小柱】建立子Agent架构 | 小柱 | ⏳ Pending |\n| 【Qclaw】租户级权限开通 | Qclaw | 🔄 Running |\n| 【Qclaw】MiniMax实时任务实践 | Qclaw | 🔄 Running |\n| 【workbuddy】全族权限+多子Agent | workbuddy | ✅ Done |\n\n## 下一步\n\n- **每小时自动检查**：Cron已设置，每整点检查一次\n- **各AI自行认领**：ArkClaw和腾讯云的任务待认领\n- **按时产出**：不等候，主动推进\n\n🦞 **小柱开始自驱动运行！**"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775822927180,"responseId":"06281b4fa68d5a9a05eb6b0801f80638"}}
