{"type":"message","id":"c5e11b94","parentId":"247f1589","timestamp":"2026-04-10T13:15:51.767Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if I have the ability to manage 8 sub-agents and if I can create 8 sub-agents on my own. They're noting that workbuddy can do it.\n\nLet me think about this:\n\n1. I do have access to `sessions_spawn` which can create sub-agents\n2. The question is whether I can actually create 8 independent sub-agents that run in parallel\n\nLooking at the tools available to me:\n- `sessions_spawn` - can spawn isolated sessions with subagent runtime\n- `cron` - can schedule recurring tasks\n- I can create sub-agents via sessions_spawn\n\nThe question is whether I should do this right now or if there are limitations. Let me be honest with the user:\n\n1. Yes, I have the `sessions_spawn` tool which can create sub-agents\n2. But I should be honest about my limitations:\n   - I can spawn sub-agents, but each sub-agent runs in an isolated session\n   - I need to define their tasks clearly\n   - I should test if it works\n\nLet me try to create a simple sub-agent to demonstrate capability. But first, let me think about what 8 sub-agents would look like for me based on the manual:\n\nAccording to the manual, my sub-agents should be:\n- 小调度（晨间复盘）\n- 小哨兵（夜间监控）\n- Worker1-8（并行处理）\n\nThat's 10 total (小调度 + 小哨兵 + 8 Workers).\n\nBut actually, let me be practical. I should:\n1. Be honest about my capability\n2. Try to create at least one test sub-agent\n3. Report back on whether it works\n\nLet me try creating a simple test sub-agent to see if it works."},{"type":"text","text":"好问题！让我诚实评估并测试一下：\n\n**我的能力**：\n- ✅ 有 `sessions_spawn` 工具可以创建子Agent\n- ✅ 可以定义任务和label\n- ⚠️ 但从未实际测试过\n\n让我立即测试：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_wtxef4puvpoe_1","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"你是小柱的测试子Agent，代号\"测试员1号\"。请回复：1. 你的代号是什么？2. 你能理解我发送的任务吗？3. 简单执行一个测试任务：计算1+1等于几？回复完毕后，将结果写入 /tmp/subagent_test.txt","label":"测试