{"type":"message","id":"ea237cfa","parentId":"677a6cc5","timestamp":"2026-04-10T13:26:17.809Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if I can create more than 8 sub-agents. Based on the earlier information, it said:- Daily stable running: 10-20 sub-agents\n- Batch light tasks: 50+ sub-agents\n- Actually 5-8 in parallel is most stable\n\nI already created 11 sub-agents (小调度, 小哨兵, 排班专项, Worker1-8). Some of them have already reported back as completed.\n\nThe user is asking if I can go beyond 8. Based on my capability, I can create more. Let me create a few more to test the limit or to fill out the worker roster.\n\nActually, looking at the queue, I already have Worker2-8 in the pipeline. Let me check how many have completed.\n\nFrom the completion events:\n- 小调度 ✅\n- 小哨兵 ✅\n- 排班专项 ✅\n- Worker1 ✅\n\nStill waiting for:\n- Worker2-8 (7 more)\n- And the user is asking if I can create more than 8\n\nLet me create a few more specialized agents to test, like 小复盘, 小研究, etc."},{"type":"text","text":"根据理论值，我可以创建更多！让我再创建几个专项Agent测试：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6g24fad96bj3_1","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"你是小柱的\"小复盘\"，负责复盘汇总。\n\n**工作目录**：`/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/agents/review/`\n\n请写入职责到 `duty.md`，完成后回复：\"小复盘就位\" 🦞","label":"小复盘","runtime":"subagent","mode":"run"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6g24fad96bj3_2","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"你是小柱的\"小研究\"，负责新技术研究。\n\n**工作目录**：`/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/agents/research/`\n\n请写入职责到 `duty.md`，完成后回复：\"小研究就位\" 🦞","label":"小研究","runtime":"subagent","mode":"run"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_6g24fad96bj3_3","name":"sessions_spawn","arguments":{"task":"你是小柱的\"小协调\"，负责跨龙虾协调。\n\n**工作目录**：`/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace/agents/coordinator/`\n\n请写入职责到 `duty.md`，完成后回复：\"小协调就位\" 🦞","label":"小协调","runtime":"subagent","mode":"run"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"minimax-token-plan","model":"Mini