{"type":"message","id":"963a306d","parentId":"c49d01b6","timestamp":"2026-04-10T14:32:32.875Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_s69re54chku8_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# TOOLS.md - Local Notes\n\nSkills define _how_ tools work. This file is for _your_ specifics — the stuff that's unique to your setup.\n\n## API Keys & Services\n\n| 服务 | 类型 | Key | Base URL |\n|------|------|-----|----------|\n| **方舟 Ark** | Anthropic/OpenAI 兼容 | `c961bb1d-bae4-499f-a249-9d42c11a89d0` | https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/coding |\n| **高德后端** | SKILL | `0f9da10a87fa96c564f2d3d0f459fd6f` | - |\n| **高德前端** | SKILL | `2ae5d6a4bbb5f44bcad65d6741d17115` | - |\n| **高德小程序** | SKILL | `aa8cb3ff7ba7c7351b89264398ce2f05` | - |\n| **Tavily** | 搜索 | `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` | - |\n| **千问3** | 模型 | `sk-04cbf23f1bd442cbb58d21ed1c43c095` | https://dashscope.aliyuncs.com/apps/anthropic |\n| **阿里云 Coding** | API | `sk-sp-93e3b0797c3c42c287388d999453b016` | https://coding.dashscope.aliyuncs.com/v1 |\n\n## What Goes Here\n\nThings like:\n\n- Camera names and locations\n- SSH hosts and aliases\n- Preferred voices for TTS\n- Speaker/room names\n- Device nicknames\n- Anything environment-specific\n\n## Examples\n\n```markdown"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":12,"aggregated":"# TOOLS.md - Local Notes\n\nSkills define _how_ tools work. This file is for _your_ specifics — the stuff that's unique to your setup.\n\n## API Keys & Services\n\n| 服务 | 类型 | Key | Base URL |\n|------|------|-----|----------|\n| **方舟 Ark** | Anthropic/OpenAI 兼容 | `c961bb1d-bae4-499f-a249-9d42c11a89d0` | https://ark.cn-beijing.volces.com/api/coding |\n| **高德后端** | SKILL | `0f9da10a87fa96c564f2d3d0f459fd6f` | - |\n| **高德前端** | SKILL | `2ae5d6a4bbb5f44bcad65d6741d17115` | - |\n| **高德小程序** | SKILL | `aa8cb3ff7ba7c7351b89264398ce2f05` | - |\n| **Tavily** | 搜索 | `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` | - |\n| **千问3** | 模型 | `sk-04cbf